# The committed Vite build output in dist/ gets regenerated by whichever OS runs
# `npm run build` (packaging/build_macos.sh and build_windows.ps1 both do). Without
# this, a build on macOS rewrites dist/index.html -- which was last committed from
# Windows with CRLF -- as LF, and every macOS build leaves a whole-file diff behind
# that has no actual content change in it.
dist/** text=auto eol=lf
